This derivative adds AsciiDoc block parsing and tests, changes the extension's
identity, commands and configuration namespace, and retains support for the
other upstream languages. The original copyright notices and Apache 2.0
license have been preserved. See LICENSE and the README for acknowledgements.

The extension icon is a composition based on the original Rewrap artwork and
the Asciidoctor visual identity (https://github.com/asciidoctor/brand), used
to identify AsciiDoc support. The composition was prepared for this fork.
